Создать Sink коннектор (Kafka → PostgreSQL):
bashcurl -X POST http://localhost:8083/connectors \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "transport-sink",
    "config": {
      "connector.class": "io.confluent.connect.jdbc.JdbcSinkConnector",
      "tasks.max": "1",
      "topics": "crash-aggregated",
      "connection.url": "jdbc:postgresql://postgres:5432/transport_db",
      "connection.user": "transport",
      "connection.password": "transport123",
      "auto.create": "true",
      "auto.evolve": "true",
      "insert.mode": "insert",
      "pk.mode": "none",
      "value.converter": "org.apache.kafka.connect.json.JsonConverter",
      "value.converter.schemas.enable": "true",
      "key.converter": "org.apache.kafka.connect.storage.StringConverter"
    }
  }'



Создать Source коннектор (PostgreSQL → Kafka):
bashcurl -X POST http://localhost:8083/connectors \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "transport-source",
    "config": {
      "connector.class": "io.confluent.connect.jdbc.JdbcSourceConnector",
      "tasks.max": "1",
      "connection.url": "jdbc:postgresql://postgres:5432/transport_db",
      "connection.user": "transport",
      "connection.password": "transport123",
      "mode": "bulk",
      "table.whitelist": "vehicles",
      "topic.prefix": "postgres-",
      "poll.interval.ms": "10000",
      "value.converter": "org.apache.kafka.connect.json.JsonConverter",
      "value.converter.schemas.enable": "false",
      "key.converter": "org.apache.kafka.connect.storage.StringConverter"
    }
  }'









Проверить статус:
bashcurl http://localhost:8083/connectors?expand=status
Удалить коннектор:
bashcurl -X DELETE http://localhost:8083/connectors/transport-sink
curl -X DELETE http://localhost:8083/connectors/transport-source
Перезапустить коннектор:
bashcurl -X POST http://localhost:8083/connectors/transport-sink/restart









